sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.leave.index)"
    participant Controller as "LeaveRequestController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka halaman Manajemen Cuti
    View->>Controller: GET /leaves
    Controller->>Model: Bangun filter (status, pegawai, jenis, bulan, tahun)
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_requests + relasi worker/leave_type
    DB-->>Model: Data pengajuan cuti
    Model-->>Controller: Koleksi + pagination

    alt Data valid (data ditemukan)
        Controller->>View: Render daftar, statistik, filter
        View-->>Admin: Tabel pengajuan cuti ditampilkan
    else Data tidak valid (kosong/error query)
        Controller->>View: Render empty state / pesan error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal menampilkan data
    end
